# f_ormat is a value as the text it prints as; n_umbers reads the
# numbers in a text (APL's format and Dyalog's quad VFI): together they
# save numbers as text and read them back (QD4).
== SOURCE
f_ormat 1 2.5 -3
t_ally f_ormat 42
n_umbers "1 2.5 -3"
n_umbers f_ormat 2 2 r_eshape 1.5 2 3 4
f_loor f_irst n_umbers " 7 "
== TYPE
Char
Int
Float
Float
Int
== RESULT
1.0 2.5 -3.0
2
1.0 2.5 -3.0
1.5 2.0 3.0 4.0
7
